infographic sequence-funnel-simple
data
  title 0-RTT early data: three gates before the fast path
  desc Each gate rejects more requests; only survivors are processed in 0-RTT
  sequences
    - label Arrives as early_data
      desc Request encrypted under the cached PSK, attached to the ClientHello
    - label Inside the replay window
      desc Server recovers real ticket age; reject if outside the ~10s window
    - label Ticket nonce unseen
      desc Single-use anti-replay cache; reject a (nonce, age) already processed
    - label Idempotent route
      desc Policy gate — mutating paths get 425 Too Early; GET/HEAD/OPTIONS pass
    - label Processed in 0-RTT
      desc Server answers before Finished, saving one full RTT for the request
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b #10b981
